abstract: >-
  A monograph and engineering handbook on the design, mathematical foundations, architecture,
  and verification of high-integrity intelligent systems (Safety-Critical & Evidence-Grounded AI).
  Introduces the Evidence-Grounded Invariant (EGI), Four-Level Knowledge Testing Pyramid (KTP),
  byte-level admission gateways, synergetic complexity reduction, and formal co-engineering of
  functional safety and cybersecurity (ISO 26262 ASIL D / DO-178C DAL A).
